    {
      "sample_index": 0,
      "text": "To calculate the cost of the painting in Chinese yuan, we need to follow these steps:\n\n1. **Convert the cost of the painting from Namibian dollars to US dollars:**\n   - We know that 1 US dollar is equal to 7 Namibian dollars.\n   - Therefore, the cost of the painting in US dollars is calculated by dividing the cost in Namibian dollars by 7.\n   \\[\n   \\text{US dollars} = \\frac{105 \\text{ Namibian dollars}}{7}\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   \\text{US dollars} = 15\n   \\]\n\n2. **Convert the cost in US dollars to Chinese yuan:**\n   - We know that 1 US dollar is equal to 6 Chinese yuan.\n   - Therefore, the cost of the painting in Chinese yuan is calculated by multiplying the cost in US dollars by 6.\n   \\[\n   \\text{Chinese yuan} = 15 \\text{ US dollars} \\times 6\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   \\text{Chinese yuan} = 90\n   \\]\n\nSo, the painting costs \\boxed{90} Chinese yuan.",
