      "sample_index": 1,
      "text": "First, we need to convert the cost of the painting from Namibian dollars to US dollars and then from US dollars to Chinese yuan. \n\nTo convert Namibian dollars to US dollars, we use the given exchange rate: \n1 US dollar = 7 Namibian dollars \nTherefore, 1 Namibian dollar = 1/7 US dollars \nSo, 105 Namibian dollars = 105 * (1/7) US dollars = 15 US dollars \n\nNext, we convert the cost of the painting from US dollars to Chinese yuan using the given exchange rate:\n1 US dollar = 6 Chinese yuan \nTherefore, 15 US dollars = 15 * 6 Chinese yuan = 90 Chinese yuan\n\nSo, the cost of the painting in Chinese yuan is 90 Chinese yuan.",
